# Witness: a chain of marks on one declaration gives the declared fields all of the chained marks; the sum is read.
# Norm: the book #data-root-declaration-execution, #qualification; the author 2026-11-18 #marking-receivers-execute, #two-kinds-of-receivers.
# Slice M1 (plan #one-graph-plan): the declarations of a field under its marks.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
sub: main () (
    int: k 0
)
    @: shared node[0]
    private: const: int: a 1
    const: private: int: b 2
    independent: const: immutable: int: c 3
    shared\Observed\seen := a * 100 + b * 10 + c
main()
